WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.789 --> 00:00:15.916
The Demon of Mighty Roots squeezed tightly.

2
00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:19.978
Cozlin and Wukong struggled against the thick, strong branches.

3
00:00:21.098 --> 00:00:24.180
Roxy stared intensely at the branch wrapped around her waist.

4
00:00:25.221 --> 00:00:27.162
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

5
00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:30.844
"Ouch! What is that?"

6
00:00:31.572 --> 00:00:34.215
The demon looked down and saw smoke rising from the branch.

7
00:00:34.235 --> 00:00:36.197
"Stop that!"

8
00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:37.058
he shouted.

9
00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:41.924
"You're burning—" Fwoomf!

10
00:00:41.984 --> 00:00:43.506
The branch burst into flames.

11
00:00:44.887 --> 00:00:48.531
The Demon of Mighty Roots dropped his captives and splashed into the river.

12
00:00:49.672 --> 00:00:52.415
Hiss! Steam rose into the sky.

13
00:00:56.524 --> 00:00:59.646
The demon swung a branch, knocking Roxy and Cozlin backward.

14
00:01:00.286 --> 00:01:02.027
Wukong swung his iron bar.

15
00:01:03.108 --> 00:01:05.769
Crack! The demon's tree trunk body cracked.

16
00:01:05.789 --> 00:01:12.593
"No!" The demon fell to the ground, unable to move.

17
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.294
Roxy and Cozlin hurried over.

18
00:01:14.314 --> 00:01:17.315
"Nice work, Wukong!"

19
00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:18.216
Roxy said.

20
00:01:18.896 --> 00:01:20.597
Cozlin pumped her fist in the air.

21
00:01:21.457 --> 00:01:22.358
Wukong grinned.

22
00:01:22.938 --> 00:01:23.799
"Watch this!"

23
00:01:24.239 --> 00:01:25.960
He raised his iron bar over his head.

24
00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:29.329
But as it swung backward, it hit Cozlin's wrist.

25
00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.832
Voop! The portal opened, pulling her, Roxy, and Wukong through.

26
00:01:37.073 --> 00:01:39.574
Bam! Roxy landed on a hard floor.

27
00:01:40.655 --> 00:01:42.536
Cozlin and Wukong landed next to her.

28
00:01:43.756 --> 00:01:46.417
They were back in the portal laboratory on Hulzar.

29
00:01:47.218 --> 00:01:48.258
Flix looked relieved.

30
00:01:48.278 --> 00:01:50.179
"I'm glad you're back!

31
00:01:50.379 --> 00:01:51.400
I was getting worried."

32
00:01:53.916 --> 00:01:54.817
"Where are we?"

33
00:01:55.097 --> 00:01:56.698
Wukong asked, looking around.

34
00:01:56.718 --> 00:01:59.600
"I was just about to destroy the demon!"

35
00:02:00.361 --> 00:02:03.223
"We're on a planet—Hulzar," Roxy said.

36
00:02:03.243 --> 00:02:05.985
"This is where we got the portal to find you."

37
00:02:07.746 --> 00:02:09.147
Flix was wringing his hands.

38
00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:13.410
"Meltron's robots have taken over more planets.

39
00:02:14.891 --> 00:02:16.512
They even attacked Hulzar.

40
00:02:19.354 --> 00:02:21.576
Luckily we can all hide deep inside the planet.

41
00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.342
The only way to get down here is with one of our portals."

42
00:02:26.622 --> 00:02:28.043
Another Hulzarian hurried over.

43
00:02:28.063 --> 00:02:30.664
"I have bad news, Flix.

44
00:02:30.965 --> 00:02:33.086
The robots have started drilling into the ground."

45
00:02:33.946 --> 00:02:34.747
Flix gasped.

46
00:02:35.187 --> 00:02:37.388
"We can't let them reach us!

47
00:02:38.629 --> 00:02:42.691
If they get our portal technology, they'll be able to go anywhere in the galaxy."

48
00:02:44.132 --> 00:02:46.593
"We don't have much time," Cozlin said.

49
00:02:46.613 --> 00:02:49.235
"We have to stop Meltron now!"

50
00:02:50.195 --> 00:02:51.576
"No!" Wukong said.

51
00:02:52.436 --> 00:02:54.157
"I have to get back to my own world!

52
00:02:55.278 --> 00:02:57.540
I was about to destroy the Demon of Mighty Roots!

53
00:02:59.181 --> 00:03:01.422
If I don't do that, he'll eat the Tang Monk!

54
00:03:02.203 --> 00:03:03.143
I can't let that happen!"

55
00:03:04.364 --> 00:03:05.285
Roxy bit her lip.

56
00:03:06.225 --> 00:03:08.027
She knew Wukong's journey was important.

57
00:03:08.987 --> 00:03:10.728
But they had an important mission here too.

58
00:03:11.689 --> 00:03:13.390
The entire galaxy was in danger.

59
00:03:14.611 --> 00:03:15.832
Roxy looked at Cozlin.

60
00:03:15.852 --> 00:03:17.753
"What should we do?

61
00:03:18.394 --> 00:03:19.975
We told Wukong we'd help him."

62
00:03:19.995 --> 00:03:22.609
"I know," Cozlin said.

63
00:03:22.629 --> 00:03:25.990
"But "What's the problem?"

64
00:03:26.371 --> 00:03:27.211
Flix asked.

65
00:03:28.052 --> 00:03:29.472
Wukong took a deep breath.

66
00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:32.594
"I was about to destroy a demon.

67
00:03:33.355 --> 00:03:34.715
But then we wound up here.

68
00:03:35.035 --> 00:03:36.336
I need to get back quickly."

69
00:03:36.356 --> 00:03:38.597
"Oh, is that all?"

70
00:03:38.998 --> 00:03:39.638
Flix asked.

71
00:03:39.658 --> 00:03:42.039
"I can adjust the portal projector.

72
00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.562
When you return home, it will make you arrive at the exact moment you left.

73
00:03:47.863 --> 00:03:49.824
That way no time will have gone by."

74
00:03:51.912 --> 00:03:52.712
Roxy was shocked.

75
00:03:53.953 --> 00:03:55.333
"You can do that?"

76
00:03:55.353 --> 00:03:58.174
"Of course," Flix said.

77
00:03:58.194 --> 00:04:00.595
"Can't you do that on your planet?"

78
00:04:01.935 --> 00:04:04.296
"Um, no," Roxy said.

79
00:04:05.016 --> 00:04:05.796
Flix shrugged.

80
00:04:05.816 --> 00:04:08.157
"That's strange."

81
00:04:09.217 --> 00:04:12.258
"Strange, you," Bippo said to Roxy.

82
00:04:12.838 --> 00:04:13.678
Roxy frowned.

83
00:04:13.698 --> 00:04:16.059
"That's not nice, Bippo."

84
00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:18.560
"Sorry, me."

85
00:04:20.844 --> 00:04:22.026
Wukong was smiling.

86
00:04:22.046 --> 00:04:25.973
"This will be like a little vacation for me.

87
00:04:26.895 --> 00:04:28.517
I was hoping for some excitement!"
